{"seq":2,"slug":"selectivity-cost-model","title":"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/selectivity-cost-model","wordCount":2277,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数\">选择率估算与代价模型代价参数</h1><p>规划器比较两个计划时从不看毫秒，只看一个无量纲的 <code>cost</code> 数字。这个数字由两段乘出来：<strong>选择率（selectivity）<strong>把「表有多少行」折算成「这个节点吐出多少行」，<strong>代价参数</strong>再把「多少行、多少页」折算成代价。EXPLAIN 里那句 <code>cost=0.00..445.00 rows=10000 width=244</code> 的前三个数字就是这两段乘法的产物。前面 §1 的 <code>./1_pg-statistic-mcv-histogram.md</code> 讲的是统计信息这张表的形状，本篇接着讲：规划器</strong>怎么用</strong>这些摘要算选择率，以及那些 GUC 常量在代价公式里各占哪一项。事实以 PostgreSQL 全球开发组官方文档为准，当前稳定版 PostgreSQL 18 于 2025-09-25 发布（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/release-18.html</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两次乘法把行数变成代价\">核心概念：两次乘法把行数变成代价</h2><p>一条 <code>Seq Scan on tenk1 (cost=0.00..445.00 rows=10000 width=244)</code> 的数字可以手工复算：<code>tenk1</code> 有 345 个数据页、10000 行，默认 <code>seq_page_cost = 1.0</code>、<code>cpu_tuple_cost = 0.01</code>，于是 <code>345 × 1.0 + 10000 × 0.01 = 445</code>（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/using-explain.html</code>）。这不是巧合——规划器内部就是这么算的，代价单位是人造的，只有相对值有意义，惯例上锚定 <code>seq_page_cost = 1.0</code>。</p>\n<p>关键在于两段乘法互相独立地引入了误差：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[WHERE 条件拆成子句] --&gt; B[逐子句估选择率]&#10;    B --&gt; C{该列有统计信息?}&#10;    C --&gt;|MCV 命中| D[直接用 most_common_freqs]&#10;    C --&gt;|落在直方图区间| E[桶内线性插值]&#10;    C --&gt;|无可用统计| F[缺省常数 DEFAULT_EQ_SEL 等]&#10;    D --&gt; G[多子句相乘&lt;br/&gt;独立性假设]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[rows = 表基数 x 选择率]&#10;    H --&gt; I[代价公式&lt;br/&gt;页数 x seq/random_page_cost&lt;br/&gt;+ 行数 x cpu_*_cost]&#10;    I --&gt; J[EXPLAIN 的 cost= 与 rows=]\">flowchart TD\n    A[WHERE 条件拆成子句] --&gt; B[逐子句估选择率]\n    B --&gt; C{该列有统计信息?}\n    C --&gt;|MCV 命中| D[直接用 most_common_freqs]\n    C --&gt;|落在直方图区间| E[桶内线性插值]\n    C --&gt;|无可用统计| F[缺省常数 DEFAULT_EQ_SEL 等]\n    D --&gt; G[多子句相乘&lt;br/&gt;独立性假设]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[rows = 表基数 x 选择率]\n    H --&gt; I[代价公式&lt;br/&gt;页数 x seq/random_page_cost&lt;br/&gt;+ 行数 x cpu_*_cost]\n    I --&gt; J[EXPLAIN 的 cost= 与 rows=]</pre><p>第一段乘法的误差来自选择率，第二段来自代价参数。实践中<strong>行数估错</strong>（第一段）远比<strong>参数调错</strong>（第二段）常见也更致命：参数错了最多让代价整体缩放、计划选择在边缘处抖一下；选择率错了三个数量级，就会让规划器把嵌套循环换成哈希连接、把索引扫描换成全表扫描。这也是为什么官方 <code>row-estimation-examples</code> 那一章花整节讲选择率，而代价常量只有一张表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规划器代价常量及其默认值\">规划器代价常量及其默认值</h2><p>PG 16 之前这些常量各有各的默认值，PG 16 之后官方把一组串联的默认值统一收紧。下表是 PostgreSQL 18 的现状，取自 <code>runtime-config-query.html</code> §19.7.2（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-query.html</code>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常量</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>在代价公式中的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>seq_page_cost</code></td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>页</td>\n<td>顺序取一页磁盘页的代价（基准锚点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>random_page_cost</code></td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n<td>页</td>\n<td>随机取一页，索引扫描/位图堆扫描的核心项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu_tuple_cost</code></td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>处理每一行的 CPU 代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu_index_tuple_cost</code></td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>索引项</td>\n<td>处理每个索引条目的代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cpu_operator_cost</code></td>\n<td>0.0025</td>\n<td>算子</td>\n<td>每个算子/函数调用的代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parallel_setup_cost</code></td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>启动并行 worker 的固定代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parallel_tuple_cost</code></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>从 worker 传一行到 leader 的代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_parallel_table_scan_size</code></td>\n<td>8MB</td>\n<td>字节</td>\n<td>低于此规模不启用并行顺序扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_parallel_index_scan_size</code></td>\n<td>512kB</td>\n<td>字节</td>\n<td>低于此规模不启用并行索引扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>effective_cache_size</code></td>\n<td>4GB</td>\n<td>字节</td>\n<td>仅供估算的磁盘缓存假设，不分配内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_above_cost</code></td>\n<td>100000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>代价超过此值启用 JIT 编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_inline_above_cost</code></td>\n<td>500000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>超过此值启用 JIT 内联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_optimize_above_cost</code></td>\n<td>500000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>超过此值启用昂贵的 JIT 优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要注意 <code>random_page_cost = 4.0</code> 与 <code>seq_page_cost = 1.0</code> 的比值 4 是 δ 机械硬盘时代留下的假设。在 NVMe SSD 上随机读延迟只有顺序读的零点几倍，4.0 会严重高估索引扫描代价，导致规划器宁可全表扫描。这就是为什么 SSD 环境下常见的调优第一条是把 <code>random_page_cost</code> 降到 1.1 或 1.0，让它接近 <code>seq_page_cost</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择率估算的三条路径\">选择率估算的三条路径</h2><p>规划器给每个子句调用一个选择率函数（<code>eqsel</code>、<code>scalarltsel</code>、<code>scalargtsel</code> 等，定义在 <code>src/backend/utils/adt/selfuncs.c</code>），返回值乘以表基数即得行数。官方 <code>row-estimation-examples</code> 给出了可手工复算的例子（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/row-estimation-examples.html</code>）：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：MCV 命中等值条件。</strong> <code>unique1 = 某MCV值</code> 直接取该值的 <code>most_common_freqs</code>。例如 <code>stringu1 = &#39;CRAAAA&#39;</code> 的频率是 0.003，行数 <code>= 10000 × 0.003 = 30</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：直方图区间内插。</strong> 范围为 <code>unique1 &lt; 1000</code>，直方图边界为 <code>{0,993,1997,...,9995}</code> 共 10 个桶。值 1000 落在第二桶 <code>993–1997</code> 内，规划器假设桶内均匀分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sel = \\frac{1 + \\dfrac{v - b_{min}}{b_{max} - b_{min}}}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2834em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.5974em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.6854em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6014em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5974em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>993</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1997</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>993</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.100697</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sel = (1 + (1000-993)/(1997-993))/10 = 0.100697</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">993</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1997</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">993</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\">/10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.100697</span></span></span></span></span>，行数 <code>= 10000 × 0.100697 = 1007</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：命中非 MCV 的值。</strong> 剩余频率被假设在剩余去重值之间均匀分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sel = \\frac{1 - \\sum f_{mcv} - null\\_frac}{n\\_distinct - n_{mcv}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.446em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>stringu1 = &#39;xxx&#39;</code> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.03033333</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>676</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0014559</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 - 0.03033333)/(676 - 10) = 0.0014559</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03033333</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">676</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0014559</span></span></span></span></span>，行数约 15。</p>\n<p>当范围条件同时涉及 MCV 与直方图时，两部分按各自代表的总体份额加权合并：<code>mcv_selectivity + histogram_selectivity × histogram_fraction</code>。还有一条兜底路径：列上<strong>完全没有统计信息</strong>时，规划器退回头文件里的缺省常数（<code>src/include/utils/selfuncs.h</code>）：<code>DEFAULT_EQ_SEL = 0.005</code>、<code>DEFAULT_INEQ_SEL = 0.3333333333333333</code>、<code>DEFAULT_RANGE_INEQ_SEL = 0.005</code>、<code>DEFAULT_UNK_SEL = 0.005</code>，<code>DEFAULT_NUM_DISTINCT = 200</code>。也就是说等值条件在无统计时一律按 1/200 估、不等条件按 1/3 估——一个未 ANALYZE 的表上，这正是估行灾难的源头。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件形式</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>无统计时的兜底</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>col = &#39;已知高频值&#39;</code></td>\n<td>MCV 频率</td>\n<td><code>DEFAULT_EQ_SEL</code> = 0.005</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>col = &#39;非 MCV 值&#39;</code></td>\n<td>剩余频率 / 剩余去重值</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>col &lt; v</code>（区间内）</td>\n<td>直方图桶内线性插值</td>\n<td><code>DEFAULT_RANGE_INEQ_SEL</code> = 0.005</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>col &lt;&gt; v</code></td>\n<td>1 − 等值选择率</td>\n<td><code>DEFAULT_INEQ_SEL</code> ≈ 0.333</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>col IS NULL</code></td>\n<td><code>null_frac</code></td>\n<td><code>DEFAULT_UNK_SEL</code> = 0.005</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多子句时规划器<strong>假设各列独立</strong>并直接相乘。<code>WHERE unique1 &lt; 1000 AND stringu1 = &#39;xxx&#39;</code> 得到 <code>0.100697 × 0.0014559 = 0.0001466</code>，行数估成 1。这个独立性假设就是相关列（城市与邮编、品牌与型号）估行严重偏低的原因，PG 10 引入的 <code>CREATE STATISTICS ... (dependencies, ndistinct, mcv)</code> 正是为修补它——它存的不是单列摘要，而是多列的<strong>函数依赖、联合去重数与高频组合</strong>，供同类同表的多条件查询使用，可用 <code>pg_stats_ext</code> 查看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价公式-启动代价与总代价的分解\">代价公式：启动代价与总代价的分解</h2><p>EXPLAIN 的 <code>cost=a..b</code> 里 <code>a</code> 是启动代价、<code>b</code> 是总代价。以顺序扫描为例，其总代价近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{seq} = N_{pages} \\times seq\\_page\\_cost + N_{rows} \\times (cpu\\_tuple\\_cost + N_{qual} \\times cpu\\_operator\\_cost)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9251em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>启动代价为 0，因为第一行无需等待任何前置工作。过滤条件会增加 <code>cpu_operator_cost</code> 项却不减少扫描的页数——所以 <code>WHERE unique1 &lt; 7000</code> 只是把 <code>445</code> 涨到 <code>470</code>、把 <code>rows</code> 从 10000 降到 7000，页数照扫：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Seq Scan on tenk1  (cost=0.00..470.00 rows=7000 width=244)&#10;  Filter: (unique1 &lt; 7000)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Seq Scan on tenk1  (cost=0.00..470.00 rows=7000 width=244)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Filter: (unique1 &#x3C; 7000)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>索引扫描的形态完全不同，它有非零启动代价，并且把 <code>random_page_cost</code> 引入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{idx} = C_{startup} + N_{idxpages} \\times seq\\_page\\_cost + N_{heapfetch} \\times random\\_page\\_cost + N_{rows} \\times (cpu\\_index\\_tuple\\_cost + cpu\\_tuple\\_cost)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9251em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里的 <code>N_heapfetch</code> 不是行数而是<strong>需要随机回表抓取的堆页数</strong>，而它受两个因素调节：一个是 §1 讲过的 <code>correlation</code>（物理序与逻辑序的相关度），相关度高时回表退化为近似顺序读，<code>random_page_cost</code> 被大幅折扣；另一个就是 <code>effective_cache_size</code>——规划器认为有多少页已在缓存中，就按多大比例把随机读降级为缓存命中。所以把 <code>effective_cache_size</code> 调高会普遍让索引扫描看起来更便宜。它<strong>不分配任何内存</strong>，只是给规划器的一个信念输入。</p>\n<p>代价是<strong>递归累加</strong>的：父节点的总代价已包含所有子节点代价。所以看到大计划时要从叶子往上读，根节点的总代价才是整个查询的总额。还有一点容易踩坑：<code>LIMIT</code> 之下的子节点仍按「跑完」报告代价与行数，而 <code>LIMIT</code> 父节点会提前停止——因此外层 <code>LIMIT 10</code> 之下出现 <code>rows=100000</code> 的排序节点时，那个 100000 是子节点<strong>若跑完</strong>的行数，不代表真的会读这么多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当估算不可信时-诊断与干预顺序\">当估算不可信时：诊断与干预顺序</h2><p>估算的价值全在于「可信」。EXPLAIN 数字与实际相差一个数量级时，按下面的顺序排查，不要一上来就调 GUC：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先看 <code>rows</code> 的偏差</strong>，而不是 <code>cost</code>。用 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 对比每节点的估算行数与 <code>actual rows</code>。PG 18 起 <code>BUFFERS</code> 默认包含在 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 中，并能显示<strong>小数行数</strong>（此前会被取整），让偏差更容易察觉（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/release-18.html</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>检查统计信息新鲜度</strong>。长时间未 ANALYZE 的表，<code>pg_class.reltuples</code> 会严重偏离真实行数，所有下游估算都被系统性缩放。</li>\n<li><strong>检查是否落入缺省常数路径</strong>。相关列、表达式条件、JSON 字段内部值这些没有直方图的对象，会静默退回 <code>DEFAULT_*</code>。表达式索引或 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 是正解。</li>\n<li><strong>最后才动代价参数</strong>。<code>effective_cache_size</code> 设为系统内存的 50%–75% 是常见做法；<code>random_page_cost</code> 按存储介质调整。它们是「微调信念」，不是「修补选择率」的手段。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有一个反直觉的结论值得记住：<strong>只要代价参数的相对比例正确，绝对大小对多数计划选择没有影响</strong>。代价只是排序依据，把 <code>seq_page_cost</code> 和 <code>random_page_cost</code> 同时乘 2，选出的计划一模一样。真正改变计划的是<strong>比值</strong>——<code>random_page_cost / seq_page_cost</code> 决定索引扫描的生死。所以调参时要问的永远是「这个比值是否符合我的存储」，而不是「这个数该填多少」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>成本 = 选择率（把基数折成行数）× 代价参数（把行数与页数折成 cost）；<code>rows = 表基数 × 选择率</code>，两步各自独立引入误差。</li>\n<li>选择率有三条路径：MCV 频率、直方图桶内线性插值、以及无统计时的缺省常数（<code>DEFAULT_EQ_SEL = 0.005</code>、<code>DEFAULT_INEQ_SEL ≈ 0.333</code>）。</li>\n<li>多子句按<strong>独立性假设</strong>相乘，这是相关列估行偏低的根因；<code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 的 <code>dependencies</code>/<code>mcv</code>/<code>ndistinct</code> 用于修补。</li>\n<li>代价常量只有<strong>相对比值</strong>有意义，惯例锚定 <code>seq_page_cost = 1.0</code>；<code>random_page_cost / seq_page_cost</code> 决定索引扫描的取舍。</li>\n<li><code>effective_cache_size</code> 只影响随机读的缓存折扣，不分配内存；SSD 环境下调低 <code>random_page_cost</code> 通常收益最大。</li>\n<li>估算不可信时按「对比 rows → 查统计新鲜度 → 查缺省常数路径 → 最后才调参」的顺序排查。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步阅读：代价算完后进入计划搜索与连接算法选择，见 <code>../3_plan-search-join/INDEX.md</code>；若要回看规划器的入口与计划缓存，见 <code>../1_parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/INDEX.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数","id":"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两次乘法把行数变成代价","id":"核心概念-两次乘法把行数变成代价"},{"level":2,"text":"规划器代价常量及其默认值","id":"规划器代价常量及其默认值"},{"level":2,"text":"选择率估算的三条路径","id":"选择率估算的三条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"代价公式：启动代价与总代价的分解","id":"代价公式-启动代价与总代价的分解"},{"level":2,"text":"当估算不可信时：诊断与干预顺序","id":"当估算不可信时-诊断与干预顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表统计信息构成：MCV、直方图与相关性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/pg-statistic-mcv-histogram"},"next":{"title":"扩展统计、表达式统计与估算偏差诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/extended-stats-estimation-bias"}}